/T (UniTrento is member of the European Alliance ECIU, the European Consortium of Innovative Universities.  ECIU is an international consortium of research-intensive universities, focused on innovation, creativity and social impact, and promoting the development of a knowledge-based economy.  In Brussels, the ECIU network supports the European Universities initiative and collaborates with European stakeholders, policy makers and opinion leaders to further develop university innovation, participating in funding calls for European programmes for knowledge and research, such as Erasmus+ and Horizon Europe.)
